{"id":"yezidabad-qalasi","qid":"Q8053356","category":"site","type":"site","names":{"az":"Yezidabad qalası","ru":"Старая крепость","en":"Yezidabad castle"},"coordinates":[45.41389,39.19528],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":null,"regionSource":null,"admin":[],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Yezidabad qalası, Köhnəqala və ya Naxçıvanqala — Azərbaycanın Naxçıvan Muxtar Respublikasında, Naxçıvan şəhərinin cənub-şərq hissəsində yerləşən tarixi istehkam və arxeoloji abidə. Elmi ədəbiyyatda Yəzdəgird qalası, yerli adlandırmada isə Torpaqqala adı ilə də göstərilir. Qalanın inşa tarixi dəqiq müəyyən edilməyib. Tikili ilk orta əsrlərə aid edilir; onun sonuncu Sasani hökmdarı III Yezdəgirdin hakimiyyəti dövründə tikilməsi barədə ehtimal da mövcuddur.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Старая крепость, Кёхня-гала или Крепость Йезидабад (азерб. — Köhnəqala, Yezidabad qalası) — древняя средневековая крепость на юго-востоке города Нахичевань. Предполагается, что крепость была построена по заказу сасанидского правителя Йездегерда III (632/633 — 651/652).","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"The Yazdegerd Castle is a pre-medieval Sassanid castle in Nakhchivan, Azerbaijan. It is constructed solely of mud. The castle is named after the last Sassanid king, Yazdegerd III (632–651).\nOutside of scientific circles the castle is commonly known as Nakhchivangala or Kohnagala. It currently houses a museum.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Nakhchivan_fortress_walls3.JPG/960px-Nakhchivan_fortress_walls3.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Nakhchivan_fortress_walls3.JPG/960px-Nakhchivan_fortress_walls3.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":600,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nakhchivan_fortress_walls3.JPG","title":"Nakhchivan fortress walls3.JPG","artist":"Самый древний","credit":"Own work","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":null,"source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q8053356: Yezidabad castle","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q8053356","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Yezidabad qalası","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Yezidabad_qalas%C4%B1&oldid=9204408","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yezidabad_qalas%C4%B1","revid":9204408,"revDate":"2026-11-17","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Старая крепость (Нахичевань)","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%A1%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_(%D0%9D%D0%B0%D1%85%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%8C)&oldid=151657330","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C_(%D0%9D%D0%B0%D1%85%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%8C)","revid":151657330,"revDate":"2026-02-11","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Yazdegerd Castle, Nakhchivan","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Yazdegerd_Castle%2C_Nakhchivan&oldid=1360506341","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yazdegerd_Castle%2C_Nakhchivan","revid":1360506341,"revDate":"2026-06-21","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Nakhchivan fortress walls3.JPG","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nakhchivan_fortress_walls3.JPG","licence":"Public domain